---
---
<section class="instalacion" id="instalacion">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="title">Instala InPDF en tu Navegador</h2>
      <p class="description">
        Sigue estos sencillos pasos para empezar a usar InPDF directamente desde Chrome.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-container">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-icon">
          <span>1</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Haz clic en el botón de abajo</h3>
        <p class="step-description">
          Te descargará un .zip que tendrás que descomprimir.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-icon">
          <span>2</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Activar modo desarrollador</h3>
        <p class="step-description">
          Activa el modo desarrollador en la página de extensiones de Chrome y pulsa en el botón que dice "Cargar descomprimida".
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-icon">
          <span>3</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Activar la extensión</h3>
        <p class="step-description">
          Activa la extensión y los PDFs se abrirán con InPDF
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-container">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/Inled-Group/inpdf-pdfjs/archive/refs/heads/main.zip"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="cta-button"
      >
        Descargar
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .instalacion {
    padding: var(--spacing-20) 0;
    background-color: var(--color-gray-50);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-16);
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .description {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .steps-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-8);
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Dotted line connector */
  .steps-container::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50px; /* Adjust vertical position of the line */
    left: 15%;
    right: 15%;
    height: 2px;
    background-image: linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-gray-300) 50%, transparent 50%);
    background-size: 20px 2px;
    background-repeat: repeat-x;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .step {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-xl);
    padding: var(--spacing-8);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gray-200);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .step:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .step-icon {
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-secondary) 100%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 4px solid var(--color-white);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--color-primary);
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-gray-800);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .step-description {
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-container {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-16);
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-secondary) 100%);
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: var(--spacing-4) var(--spacing-8);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .steps-container::before {
      display: none; /* Hide line on medium screens */
    }
    .steps-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .description {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }
  }
</style>
